      "content": "i've checked the logs and it's super weird. the changes happen at super inconsistent times, like it's not a regular schedule. it feels like someone is watching when i'm home or when i'm asleep to mess with me. my ex used to be really tech savvy and he always had access to my accounts before the breakup... do u think it's possible he's still finding ways in even after i changed my passwords? like maybe through a backdoor or a shared device?",
